Hi {Owner},

I build websites for orthodontists around {City}. {Business Name} has warm reviews from parents, but no way to book your free consult online and no payment plan ranges for families comparing practices on a phone.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: free consult booking, a braces-or-aligners comparison, payment plan and benefits ranges, an early check page for young children and a loose-bracket page for current patients, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain your practice owns and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and edits. You approve every page, and nothing promises a result. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

